without replacing these scope and lineage limits with a blanket license.

The Adwaita, Ambiance, Breeze, Default, OSX Arc and Radiance records do not
establish a separate original artwork grant; Windwood retains its declared
Ambiance dependency. This is a documented evidence limit, not proof of an
absence of permission. Per-family sources, comparison method, recovered
licenses and remaining limits are recorded in docs/asset-provenance.md in the
corresponding sources. These records do not claim EGO approval.
